'''North Stars''' are a [[Currency]] that can be used to buy items from {{NPCSprite|Einary}} in {{zone|Einary's Emporium}}.

== Obtaining ==
'''North Stars''' have a chance to be obtained when the player opens [[Gifts]] or another player opens a gift given to them by the player.
